[b]Up, Down, Left, Right[/b] = Grow branch in dirrection, adds 3 spaces for a flower or leaf.

[b]Flower[/b] = Grow a flower. Once watered, takes 2 sugar per second until grown into a ripe fruit.

[b]Leaf[/b] = Grow a leaf that makes 1 sugar per second"

